#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build research/amm-multi-hop-split-boost-tf-boost-trade-five-hop-chains-20261029 receipts.

3rd run packet #156: the split x boost x tf chain at TRUE 5 hops
(three_amm + g4 + g5, final output U5) meets the boost-trade
interaction. Every sequence is pinned fresh on this chain:
boost-then-trade, trade-then-boost, alternating legs, failed legs,
boost x buckets/buyback/sweep/collect, boost x claims, transfer-fee
variants, boost-size x trade, boost x deposit/withdraw, terminal
hop (P5) boosts in the walk, and outsider-signed boosts in the
walk. The #102 3-hop interaction families are re-measured at
depth 5; the depth-5 deltas (5-hop tails, terminal hop boosts,
depth-5 post-trade burns) are the new pins.

MEASURE=1 prints MEAS lines; /tmp/meas2expect156.py turns them into
EXPECTS. Without MEASURE it writes the packet (receipts in 10-receipt
parts, report.json.gz) and prints the addresses verify.py needs.
"""
